// Ch14 B01 optional talk: Liss at the dais steps in a borrowed good coat she keeps tugging at.
title: ch14_talk_liss
location: ch13/ansedra_lacquer_court
---
Liss [worried]: Don't. Don't say anything nice. I'll fall apart and I've got to hand him the ring. #line:ch14_liss_001
Liss [soft_smile]: Three years I spent on this. Three years of being polite to Wardens. #line:ch14_liss_002
===
